  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FairChain Foundation further development as knowledge and network partner for Impact</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rolling out business plan 2022-2026 to ensure substantial growth and build self-supporting business model. Engaging more target customers (Coops &amp; Impact brands) to grow and support purpose driven brands in design of new economic business models that aim to be net positive, give more than they take and contribute to the SDG?s. 
FairChain Foundation focusses on knowledge, networking, sponsors and initiates systemic change. 
FairChain Tech provides the technology and impact network to provide impact brands the low-cost, DIY impact they seek</narrative>
  </description>
